Hello

I have a data frame with (a) household ID (b) Individual ID (c) Other variables. For each household ID, I have two individuals.

I want to create two equal sized data frames, and randomly assign individuals within a household to the data frames. Thus if Individual 1 of Household 1 is assigned to data frame 1, then the Individual 2 of the same household is assigned to data frame 2.

Which function / package should I use.

Thanks for your time.

