How to do this using base R:

orig$group <- unlist(tapply(orig$ind, orig$hh, function(x) sample(0:1, 2)))
df1 <- orig[orig$group == 0,]
df2 <- orig[orig$group != 0,]

Probably a more elegant way to do this as well (if I think of it post-coffee, I will post it).

Matt

