Hi Michael,

To do it quickly you might break the data.frame into two and reshape them separately.

For a better solution, it would be easier for me (probably others too) if you provided your data (just a sample) in a format easily inputtable into R. You could do the following, assuming you already have your data in a data.frame in R that is named dat:

dput(head(dat))

and then paste the results into the email.

